# Public keys whose agent programs the Signalith Agent updates itself to,
# one base64 Ed25519 key per line. The private key is the
# SIGNALITH_AGENT_KEY secret the release build signs the agent programs
# with; docs/releasing.md says how to make one and add it here. With no key
# here, agents never update themselves: run the install line again instead.
QJVUiMjXXRzRDXbv3vuwFSBrqa6xiDrFk47LEx5ZTeA=
